# Project page credits

When creating a new project page that is **not** a type project, the intro meta must always include all four fields, in this order:

1. Year
2. Client
3. Art-direction
4. Deliverables

Match existing markup (`Art&#8209;direction` non-breaking hyphen). Use Bora as the template. Ask for any unknown values instead of omitting a field.

Type projects (e.g. Tangley) skip this credit list.

On project pages, only hero SVGs follow `--ink` when the theme changes. Story and other project images keep their original colours. To skip theming on a hero SVG, add `data-keep-color` to the `img` or a parent.
